motanka-core (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: the motanka command, upstream Omarchy v4.5.0
    (ac2690cd) vendored unmodified, the compatibility layer and the
    Motanka session.
  * Session fonts: depend on motanka-fonts; the launcher sets
    FONTCONFIG_PATH to /opt/motanka/share/motanka/fontconfig, whose
    fonts.conf adds /opt/motanka/share/fonts and upstream's fontconfig
    rules to the system configuration.
  * motanka-default-theme.service runs upstream's install/user/theme.sh once
    per user in the running session; overrides for omarchy-theme-set-pi and
    omarchy-theme-set-fcitx5 keep files other sessions read unchanged.

